# GitHub Configuration
# Create a separate fine-grained token restricted to chartishq-cool/cool-try.
# Required repository permissions: Contents read/write and Actions read.
# Store the token only in the separate Chartishq deployment. Do not commit it.
GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_token_here

# Repository that contains .github/workflows/screener.yml, in owner/repo format.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GITHUB_REPO=chartishq-cool/cool-try

# Note: NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables are visible to the browser in Next.js.
# GITHUB_TOKEN is read only by API routes and must stay server-side.
